          "quote": "We study experimentally the compressive creep deformation behavior of a woven structure, created from Ni-20Cr-3Ti-2Al (wt.%) superalloy wires, under uniaxial compression at elevated temperature. The woven structure exhibits a creep strain rate of 2 /C2 10/C0 7 s/C0 1 under an applied compressive stress of 5 MPa at 825 /C14 C, which is much higher than expected if the wires remain parallel to the applied load.",
